📊 Excel Project Summary: Sales Report Analysis with Conditional Formatting
✅ Client Requirement
The client provided a dataset of employee sales performance and requested enhanced visual insights using conditional formatting. The goals were:

Highlight Bonus Eligibility:
Differentiate employees who are eligible for bonuses.
✅ Green fill for "Yes" and ❌ Red fill for "No" in the "Bonus Eligible" column.

Highlight Leave-Taking Employees:
Visualize the number of leaves taken.

📊 Data bars applied to the "Leaves Taken" column to show leave frequency.

Highlight Top 10 Ratings:

Identify top performers based on ratings.
⭐ Applied Top 10 Rule using conditional formatting in the "Rating" column.

🧾 What Was Done?

Imported and cleaned a dataset with 100+ employee records.
Applied three layers of conditional formatting to highlight critical insights:
Bonus eligibility with color-coded indicators.
Leave frequency using visual data bars.
Top-rated employees using "Top 10" conditional rules.

🎯 Client Requirement Fulfilled?

✅ Yes, all client requirements were successfully met:
Clear visual cues for bonus eligibility.
Data bars offer intuitive insight into leaves taken.
Top 10 performers are easily identifiable.
